SHA256: 1247dbbc30a65dcf76a2c4781805c19ef80333b0d6d9c0e1e5821f5b37334d04
Description: worldiety Hub controlplane: central control and certificate authority
 The controlplane is the central point of the worldiety Hub. Runners,
 proxies, builders, the managementplane and web join it, receive their
 certificates from it and get their work through it. It hosts no
 applications itself.
 .
 The service wdyhub-controlplane starts right after the installation and
 keeps its data in /var/lib/wdyhub/controlplane.d. "wdyhub-controlplane
 help" explains its commands, /etc/wdyhub/controlplane.env its settings.
 The installation creates that file from
 /usr/share/wdyhub/controlplane.env.example if it is missing; updates
 never change it.

